OL,3,AFlash flood on Nepal-Tibet border kills
OL,4,Aat least 95, with hundreds of foreign
OL,5,Atourists missing
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 95 people have been killed,
OL,8,Fand hundreds of tourists are missing,
OL,9,Fafter a massive flash flood and
OL,10,Fmudslide on the Nepal-Tibet border
OL,12,FThe missing tourists include more than
OL,13,F100 from India, 47 from the US, and 33
OL,14,Ffrom the UK, according to Nepal's
OL,15,Ftourist board. The area is popular with
OL,16,Fpilgrims and trekkers
OL,18,FCCTV from Tibet shows a wall of water
OL,19,Fand mud hitting buildings at a border
OL,20,Fcrossing - other images from Nepal show
OL,21,Fpeople trying to flee as the flood
OL,22,Fsurges
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
